Stunt Double 
	11PP
Skill: (Risky Maneuver) 

- This is a unique and valuable shield-like unit that can only be activated in battle once per time being hired. Since it costs 1 PP to initialize, the actual utility lies in the remaining 10.  

-It stays out on the field indefinitely during the battle it is used, unless the PP runs out. The player’s choice of a different defense skill is automatically skipped while active.

-When the player gets hit, each time they will receive no damage but instead spend 1 PP assigned to the Stunt Double. Upon reaching 0 PP, the Stunt Double will instantly leave your team.

-If any PP still remains when the battle ends, they will still leave regardless. HOWEVER, the price of hiring Stunt Doubles in the future will be discounted by a percentage equal to your PP remaining.

10PP from doing a no-hit fight= 10% for example. 
This effect may stack during the course of a run, but caps at 50% maximum.




